{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world consumed by the endless ocean, where nations and technology have fallen into ruin, and every scrap of land is worth its weight in gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across a mysterious and perilous archipelago in search of your family \u2014 and perhaps something beyond that.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is non-linear, allowing you to venture beyond the main storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden locations and dungeons, uncover treasures, encounter new stories, and face dangerous enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time combat against a variety of foes and formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons and equipment with unique traits that can completely change your fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/944d9966619058867e0ae33c4c5032ed.poster.avif?t=1768540112\" width=480 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/944d9966619058867e0ae33c4c5032ed.webm?t=1768540112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/944d9966619058867e0ae33c4c5032ed.mp4?t=1768540112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set sail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks both on land and at sea \u2014 upgrade your ship to survive brutal ocean trials on your path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea depths also hide countless secrets. Explore them\u2026 if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/ba1b461c45d8d91cf85a971f33b35304.avif?t=1768540112\" width=1282 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you\u2019ll meet remarkable characters, each with their own secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will lend you a hand, while others may seek to manipulate you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of your lost family, you will uncover the mystery of a towering enigma while delving into the darker waters of your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to bear the weight of your own choices?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922200?t=1768540112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/3fb823e7714a803f3dc14baaffe9f775579fbaeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768540112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/14e44100edc22fc7218858d60aac818752d355a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768540112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/14e44100edc22fc7218858d60aac818752d355a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768540112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all ages: violence, references to alcohol and tobacco."},"demos":[{"appid":3963930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world consumed by the endless ocean, where nations and technology have fallen into ruin, and every scrap of land is worth its weight in gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across a mysterious and perilous archipelago in search of your family \u2014 and perhaps something beyond that.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is non-linear, allowing you to venture beyond the main storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden locations and dungeons, uncover treasures, encounter new stories, and face dangerous enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time combat against a variety of foes and formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons and equipment with unique traits that can completely change your fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/944d9966619058867e0ae33c4c5032ed.poster.avif?t=1768540112\" width=480 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/944d9966619058867e0ae33c4c5032ed.webm?t=1768540112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/944d9966619058867e0ae33c4c5032ed.mp4?t=1768540112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set sail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks both on land and at sea \u2014 upgrade your ship to survive brutal ocean trials on your path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea depths also hide countless secrets. Explore them\u2026 if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922200/extras/ba1b461c45d8d91cf85a971f33b35304.avif?t=1768540112\" width=1282 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you\u2019ll meet remarkable characters, each with their own secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will lend you a hand, while others may s